{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_08_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_08","title":"命運","storyCode":"LE-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"f427caa469c371d64866896c0ff7dcebca6b43026f66b9d94a162f828e0d8a9e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子，真是個傻孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明可以不用做這樣的事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地欠你這麼多，你又何必做到這一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請您趕快離開！這裡的源石活性正在不斷上升！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想見我孫子最後一面呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差最後一下了，芙蓉，拜託你牽制他的注意力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，爺爺在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，我親愛的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你覺得有怨氣，就衝我來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你毀掉更多東西之前，先衝我來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我騙了你許多年，瞞了你許多年......我想過因你而死，卻沒想過你會遭遇這樣的結局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你選擇讓其他人活下去，那就讓時日無多的我隨你而去，又有何妨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我再陪你一程吧，我親愛的孩子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石結晶組成的怪物不能理解老人的話。\n剛剛那瞬間的清醒已經是奇跡中的奇跡，此時的怪物只想隨著大提琴聲，將四周拖入永久的虛無。\n於是，怪物循著聲音傳來的方向，全力噴吐死亡的旋律。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你何必——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——黑鍵，這裡由我擋住，趁現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"友情、犧牲、奉獻——如此幼稚的信念，就應該在現實中摔得粉身碎骨，憑什麼，憑什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，還沒有結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊確實把兩段塵世之音強行納入了自己這一側，可他最終還是敵不過它們疊加在一起的無序和瘋狂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽得見，白堊的旋律已經消散殆盡，但黑鍵的塵世之音並未離去，我還——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，斯特羅洛伯爵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"格特魯德剛剛搭上琴弦的手無力地垂下。\n別格勒把匕首從格特魯德的後背抽出，血染髒了他的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石外殼層層崩解。\n廣場上失去了聲音，只有失去活性的源石外殼落在地上的沉悶響動。\n最後，外殼盡數剝落，留在原地的，是奄奄一息的白堊，還有他身邊的大提琴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等著我......等著我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！他現在很危險，我們該做的是呼叫感染者臨終事務處......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......白堊不會死的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，你醒了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了嗎，白堊有救的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡，我在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別......白費力氣了，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得......身體好輕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛一直很痛，但現在好多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，會好的，肯定會好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了，黑鍵，這是我最後一次跟你說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記著我的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，你要活下去，你要走過漫長的夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去反抗那些不公的命運，並且孜孜不倦地為他人付出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，當你坐下來的時候，才會想到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會問你，黑鍵，你今天過得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，你會挺起胸膛告訴我，你又度過了充實的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會向我傾訴你在行善過程中遭遇的障礙，以及抱怨命運始終不願青睞於你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是沒有關係，我會傾聽你的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你是那麼努力，你當然可以去抱怨一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，你才不會被這片大地上的苦痛所淹沒，你才能在你的生活中獲得安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記著，黑鍵，我們曾經一同反抗了不公平的命，而我們得了勝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，想到我的時候，你應當笑，而不是哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，對不起啊，黑鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有想好......應該給你什麼信物比較......好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你送我什麼都可以的，求求你別死，求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，白堊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊！！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們總有一天會摔得粉身碎骨的，但不是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"友情、犧牲、奉獻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們可能確實有些幼稚，但至少有人會為他們掬一把同情淚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你呢，斯特羅洛伯爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你親手毀掉了自己和車爾尼之間萌生的友情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你殺掉了自己的親兄弟，還要嘲弄他的無能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓別人為你奉獻，可你給了別人什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......實在太難看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認自己剛剛有些衝動，但緊急處理威脅大眾安全的因素，這也是我的職責之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會替你寫一份詳實的報告的，斯特羅洛伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安，祝你做個不用詛咒別人的夢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手在流血！難道是被源石結晶刺到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好像......是出了點血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你得立刻接受必要的救治——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救治？現在要救治的是白堊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說那個詞，芙蓉，我求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......畢竟是感染者，黑鍵，就當是為他考慮，如果你不想聯繫感染者臨終事務處，至少找個密封性良好的房間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就......音樂廳休息室吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我送他過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，來，我抱你進去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑鍵小心翼翼地抱起白堊，身上被源石刺出更多傷口，但他無暇顧及。\n他抱著朋友慢慢失去溫度的身體，就像抱著一個短暫而美好的夢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g9_auditorium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，我們馬上就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快的，很快我們就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還——活著？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就帶你出去，去找芙蓉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把我安頓在這座建築裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你以後還能回到夕照區，你就會想起，你有一個很好很好的朋友，你和他在這裡爭吵過，歡笑過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後，你和他共同獻上了一場精彩的合奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，你不是白堊，你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這難道不是你想要的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭，閉嘴，我不允許你這樣玷污他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊為了清除塵世之音付出了生命，可塵世之音......還在我的腦子裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我警告你，如果你還想模仿他，我不介意在這把自己的頭打爆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腦海中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘆息聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腦海中的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我愚蠢的血脈啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"再沒有什麼聲音出現在黑鍵耳畔。\n他只是抱著白堊越來越沉重的身體，一步一步地朝夕照廳的休息室走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g11_lounge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去做密封工作，你在沙發上躺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的沙發挺軟的，你躺著一定很舒服——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙發、軟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至沒睡過家裡的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我大概真是感染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前要花點精力才能用的法術，現在幾乎不費勁。看來感染了也挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，這樣就差不多了。門等我出去再封上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......什麼願望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紀念......對了，紀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把大提琴，我就拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給你買的東西，現在我又要拿走，真是......"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑鍵的嘴唇動了動，沒說出話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他靜靜站立片刻，彎下腰，輕輕把自己用慣了的長笛放在白堊身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你之前說想要一個鑽了孔的硬幣，可我現在只剩這把長笛了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
